{"id": "DeegobPHB0I", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Your FASTag has no battery. So how does it pay your toll? 🚗\n\nThe toll reader's radio waves power a tiny chip in the sticker. The chip can't transmit, so it reflects the signal back, flickering it to spell out your tag's ID (that's backscatter). NETC routes that ID to your bank, the toll is deducted, and the barrier lifts.\n\nSave this for your next road trip 🛣️\n\n#fastag #rfid #techexplained #howtechworks #roadtrip", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1791986405, "like_count": 33, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140053735575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.221, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNfLvP8T8zjDo7HNYy7Jvf1GUr9CVCiLPfG3r4rmyG1E7jGK1bpAUlvtEX75NuLitY1styPEXDd8ZT4b0q5vinbKrSlpu3d6bcOqTc.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=Adoxh2OI0GNLnNjMLTuplm-nnxmpGebLfXD9qfFEHCtBTnDe5Htvv1WCVRlyoCPbvVGRZ9WFmhH2Us9c86xp1Ijw&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=YaLTIMKMZSoQ7kNvwHBTxUg&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=V7ib2_IgJxkD_afuhttAzg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSP0hBe8_XvBPtynB4ZRj2hIbsVEU2wDL9cmPOj7WyLFg&oe=6AF411BC", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 63.221, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-18140053735575820a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"